The bug is in the `reserve` method: it checks and deducts stock sequentially. If a later item fails the check, earlier items have already been deducted, violating the "all-or-nothing" requirement stated in the docstring. Additionally, there is no check for `qty` being a positive integer (allowing negative quantities to add stock).

